    "extractor: The concept application must be written in English. D3 says no charitable-status evidence is required at the concept stage, but evidence may be provided at the proposal stage. D2 lists concept windows of October 15–December 22 and May 1–June 15, with full-proposal deadlines of February 15 and August 15; years are not stated. D1, D2, and D3 differ on application frequency: one proposal per calendar year, one per review cycle, and one every 12 months. D1 also allows upper-income-country organisations working with local partners in eligible regions. D1 requires interim progress reports, interim financial reports, and second-year work plans for multi-year grants.",
